}


ImportShipsUI ..> ImportShipsController
ImportShipsController ..> Import

SearchShipUI ..> SearchShipController
SearchShipController ..> Company
SearchShipController ..> ShipMapper
SearchShipController .> ShipStore

PositionalMessagesUI ..> PositionalMessagesController
PositionalMessagesController ..> Company

SummaryUI ..> SummaryController
SummaryController ..> Company

Conversions -- ListShipController: Makes unit convertions >
ListShipController -- ShipStore : gets list of ships >

CloseShipInfoUI ..> PairOfShipsController
PairOfShipsController ..> Company
PairOfShipsController ..> ShipStore

Import --> Company
Import -> ShipStore
Company -> ShipStore : uses >
ShipStore "1" ->  "*" Ship: stores >
Ship "1" -> "*" AISMessage: contains >
ShipStore -> ShipTree


ShipMapper ..> ShipDTO
ShipMapper .> AISMessageMapper
ShipMapper ..> Ship
AISMessageMapper ..> AISMessage
AISMessageMapper .> AISMessageDTO





@enduml